      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“상대를 얼린다는 건\n매우 강력한 공격이야!”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "201CC0C1B300B97C0020C5BCB9B0B2E4B2940020AC74000AB9E4C6B00020AC15B825D55C0020ACF5ACA9C774C57C0021201D00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“일단 얼려 버리면\n너의 포켓몬은<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n전혀 움직일 수 없게 되니까.”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "201CC77CB2E80020C5BCB8240020BC84B9ACBA74000AB108C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC74000100001BE00000AC804D6000020C6C0C9C1C77C0020C2180020C5C6AC8C0020B418B2C8AE4C002E201D00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 동경하는\n포켓몬 트레이너를 흉내 내 봤어요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그분은 얼음타입 전문가라서\n저도 따라서 키우고 있답니다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC000020B3D9ACBDD558B294000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020D2B8B808C774B108B97C0020D749B0B40020B0B40020BD24C5B4C694002E00100001BE01000AADF8BD84C7400020C5BCC74CD0C0C7850020C804BB38AC00B77CC11C000AC800B3C40020B530B77CC11C0020D0A4C6B0ACE00020C788B2F5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떠세요?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n제 얼음타입 포켓몬과\n싸늘한 승부를 겨뤄 보시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A0C138C694003F00100001BE01000AC81C0020C5BCC74CD0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACACFC000AC2F8B298D55C0020C2B9BD80B97C0020ACA8B9040020BCF4C2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "싸늘한 승부를 원하신다면\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2F8B298D55C0020C2B9BD80B97C0020C6D0D558C2E0B2E4BA74000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 얼음타입 포켓몬과\n승부를 겨뤄 보시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020C5BCC74CD0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACACFC000AC2B9BD80B97C0020ACA8B9040020BCF4C2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너무 싸늘한 건 몸에 안 좋긴 하죠.\n마음이 바뀌면 다시 말을 걸어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108BB340020C2F8B298D55C0020AC740020BAB8C5D00020C5480020C88BAE340020D558C8E0002E000AB9C8C74CC7740020BC14B00CBA740020B2E4C2DC0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "덕분에 동경하는 트레이너의\n다른 대사를 말할 수 있게 됐어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B355BD84C5D00020B3D9ACBDD558B2940020D2B8B808C774B108C758000AB2E4B9780020B300C0ACB97C0020B9D0D5600020C2180020C788AC8C0020B410C5B4C694002100100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“...아하하하!\n그럼, 각오는 됐겠지!?”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "201C002E002E002EC544D558D558D5580021000AADF8B7FC002C0020AC01C624B2940020B410ACA0C9C00021003F201D00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“제법 하는구나!”<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“응...!\n다음 방으로 가도 좋아!”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "201CC81CBC950020D558B294AD6CB0980021201D00100001BE01000A201CC751002E002E002E0021000AB2E4C74C0020BC29C73CB85C0020AC00B3C40020C88BC5440021201D00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앗...\n흉내가 너무 과했네요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C557002E002E002E000AD749B0B4AC000020B108BB340020ACFCD588B124C694002E00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼, 강하시군요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n참고로 포켓몬이 얼어 버려도\n기다리면 알아서 녹으니 걱정 마세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC002C0020AC15D558C2DCAD70C694002100100001BE01000ACC38ACE0B85C0020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020C5BCC5B40020BC84B824B3C4000AAE30B2E4B9ACBA740020C54CC544C11C0020B179C73CB2C80020AC71C8150020B9C8C138C694002E00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "화염바퀴, 스팀버스트,\n플레어드라이브를 배우고 있다면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n해당 기술로 얼음을 녹일 수도 있어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D654C5FCBC14D034002C0020C2A4D300BC84C2A4D2B8002C000AD50CB808C5B4B4DCB77CC774BE0CB97C0020BC30C6B0ACE00020C788B2E4BA7400100001BE00000AD574B2F90020AE30C220B85C0020C5BCC74CC7440020B179C77C0020C218B3C40020C788C5B4C694002E00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그건 그렇고, 미르시티에 빙원이라고 불러도\n이상하지 않을 장소가 생기다니<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n뭔가 신비하고 멋진 것 같지 않나요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC740020ADF8B807ACE0002C0020BBF8B974C2DCD2F0C5D00020BE59C6D0C774B77CACE00020BD88B7ECB3C4000AC774C0C1D558C9C00020C54AC7440020C7A5C18CAC000020C0DDAE30B2E4B2C800100001BE00000ABB54AC000020C2E0BE44D558ACE00020BA4BC9C40020AC830020AC19C9C00020C54AB098C694003F00100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도시에 야생 포켓몬들이 늘어난 덕분에\n다양한 변화를 즐길 수 있게 된 걸 거예요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n전 이제 얼음타입 포켓몬들과\n차가운 그라니타를 즐겨야겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
